{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-hello-sunday-mineral-eye-cream-spf-50-2602-0173","content_id":"27161abf-1021-45da-bc1a-81abe622a791","description":"Product Recall for Hello Sunday Mineral Eye Cream SPF50 presenting a risk to health.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"872155d4-ef7e-4308-aa91-a535516bad75","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-02-21T11:06:53+00:00","id":"872155d4-ef7e-4308-aa91-a535516bad75","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-02-21T11:06:53+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/699991cd339ee33f3ad0ba33/2602-0173-product-recall-hello-sunday-eye-cream.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Hello Sunday - The One for Your Eyes Eye Cream SPF 50</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk to health as it may not provide adequate protection.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Cosmetics, personal care and grooming - Sun Protection Products</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Hello Sunday</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Name</td>\n      <td>Hello Sunday - The One for Your Eyes Eye Cream SPF50</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Receipt and Price Ticket Code (TK Maxx sales)</td>\n      <td>079989</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sales Period (TK Maxx sales)</td>\n      <td>December 2025 - February 2026</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Batches</td>\n      <td>All batches</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Spain</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Eye cream in mint green packaging with pink labelling.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_872155d4-ef7e-4308-aa91-a535516bad75\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/699991cd339ee33f3ad0ba33/2602-0173-product-recall-hello-sunday-eye-cream.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product has failed SPF testing with variable results. The product may not provide adequate protection and could increase the risk of sun-related skin damage and sunburn.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of Regulation (EC) 1223/2009 (The Cosmetics Regulation).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by Hello Sunday.</p>\n\n<p>Owners of the product are advised to cease use immediately and return the product to their place of purchase for a full refund or replacement.</p>\n\n<p>For more information, access the Hello Sunday website at: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.hellosundayspf.com/pages/the-one-for-your-eyes-statement?srsltid=AfmBOoqusDWZ7wh9xpdKKH9CH_tgI0tDLpRfHfbkyWydzMS93OlCR2wq\">The One For Your Eyes Statement – Hello Sunday SPF</a></p>\n\n<p>For products sold by Boots, access: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.boots.com/product-recall?srsltid=AfmBOorjNfnp3P8GbZwf9QDrxHsDL78ZdzY6P_JK7scnC5eEUqi9f32X\">Product recall - Boots</a></p>\n\n<p>For products sold by TK Maxx, access: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.tkmaxx.com/uk/en/l/product-recall\">Safety notice - Product Recall - TK Maxx UK</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2602-0173</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-21T11:07:17Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"cosmetics","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-02-21","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-02-21T11:07:17+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-hello-sunday-mineral-eye-cream-spf-50-2602-0173","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-hello-sunday-mineral-eye-cream-spf-50-2602-0173","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-hello-sunday-mineral-eye-cream-spf-50-2602-0173","content_id":"27161abf-1021-45da-bc1a-81abe622a791","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-02-21T11:07:17Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Hello Sunday Mineral Eye Cream SPF 50 (2602-0173)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-hello-sunday-mineral-eye-cream-spf-50-2602-0173","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of 